abstract: >-
  Code, answer data, result files and the study protocol of a study of AI agents
  that call tools with closed lists of allowed values. A traveller who asks for
  "a hotel" can mean any place to stay, but the search tool accepts only the
  values hotel and guesthouse. The study measures how the name of an allowed
  value changes what the agent searches for, while every call stays valid. It
  reports a registered test, a release test for schema updates, and an
  evaluation of neural and symbolic repairs.
keywords:
